     "text": "An equation joins two expressions with an equal sign, like 3x − 1 = 6. A linear equation has the variable only to the power 1, like x + 3 = 2x − 1. 2x² + 3 = 2x − 1 is not linear. The left part is the L.H.S, the right part the R.H.S."
    }
